================================================================================
  CONNECTION TO EDGE COUNT
================================================================================

  The edge formula: |E| ≈ T/(2+ε) where ε → 0
  T = V + m_(n-1,1) + m_(n-2,2)
  |E| ≈ V/2 + m_(n-1,1)/2 + m_(n-2,2)/2  (if ε→0)
  The 'correction' to V*m/2 comes from m_(n-1,1) and m_(n-2,2)

  n=3: V=2, m_(n-1,1)=2, m_(n-2,2)=0, T=4
